  "binding": "OfficialBattleRequest.PlayerAppearance -> OfficialBattleSceneView.TryCreatePlayer",
  "operation": "Bind an explicitly selected player unit to a read-only profile and item-type lookup. The shared scene creates and owns its original native model/resources, including when restoring zero HP. Dispatch extracted movement leaves through the original player/partner controller interface; complete native cast graphs retain exclusive ownership of their Animator leaves. Shared HP refresh starts death, retains the role and revives it; dispose roles before shared player resources.",
  "limits": [
    "Host modes must still provide the profile binding and stop attaching borrowed map avatars.",
    "The model view does not complete original player HUD, fade or every skill/status graph.",
    "Validation uses the shared scene with local profile projections; UI input, disk saves and Windows Player remain separate."
  ]
